21
00:00:41,573 --> 00:00:43,202
- Let's set out - Let's set out

22
00:00:43,203 --> 00:00:44,572
After the puppy run...

23
00:00:44,573 --> 00:00:48,213
(Moomoo came up with the whale run based on the GPS.)

24
00:00:48,543 --> 00:00:50,443
(Will Moo Do Ra Ji start their run at last?)

25
