(It was hilarious that they took a taxi.)

29
00:00:57,223 --> 00:00:58,323
(They spent a lot of money on food and taxis. It's hilarious.)

30
00:00:58,523 --> 00:01:00,523
(When will you guys start running?)

31
00:01:00,853 --> 00:01:02,622
(Before our run,)

32
00:01:02,623 --> 00:01:04,323
