41
00:01:20,813 --> 00:01:24,783
(Team Moo Do Ra Ji was sailing smoothly.)

42
00:01:25,713 --> 00:01:27,483
(Are you all right?)

43
00:01:27,983 --> 00:01:29,823
(Na Ra took care of the crew and the butter.)

44
00:01:30,753 --> 00:01:33,623
(He successfully made real butter.)

45
00:01:35,193 --> 00:01:37,263
(Captivated by the first taste of the Fun Run)

46
00:01:38,493 --> 00:01:39,692
(I love it.)

47
00:01:39,693 --> 00:01:40,893
They're gotten close now.

48
00:01:41,863 --> 00:01:43,563
(I'm so happy to be part of the 1st crew.)

49
00:01:44,403 --> 00:01:46,202
Hyun Moo, which way do we have to go?

50
00:01:46,203 --> 00:01:47,273
We can keep going straight.

51
