- Keep going straight. - Go straight.

52
00:01:50,003 --> 00:01:51,703
We'll complete the head then.

53
00:01:51,943 --> 00:01:54,013
- We're halfway there now. - We'll trace the top of the head.

54
00:01:54,643 --> 00:01:56,883
- Okay. See that rice cake store? - Yes.

55
00:01:57,143 --> 00:01:58,783
We have to turn right at the rice cake store.

56
00:01:59,343 --> 00:02:00,612
We'll complete the head then.

57
00:02:00,613 --> 00:02:02,013
- They're already halfway there. - I bet it's tasty.

58
00:02:04,453 --> 00:02:06,022
- Let's go. - Watch out for your knees.

59
00:02:06,023 --> 00:02:07,293
(Glancing)

60
00:02:07,953 --> 00:02:09,192
Hey, we're going uphill now.

61
00:02:09,193 --> 00:02:12,063
(Spotting)

62
00:02:12,663 --> 00:02:13,762
Gosh, it's quite an uphill.

63
00:02:13,763 --> 00:02:15,032
(They didn't expect the steep incline.)

64
00:02:15,033 --> 00:02:16,062
- It's steep. - We can do this.

65
00:02:16,063 --> 00:02:17,063
We can do this.

66
00:02:18,103 --> 00:02:19,303
Gosh, why is there an uphill?

67
