69
00:02:24,073 --> 00:02:26,873
I had no idea that there would be an uphill climb.

70
00:02:27,073 --> 00:02:28,413
Had I known about the elevation,

71
00:02:29,913 --> 00:02:30,982
I would've gotten rid of the head.

72
00:02:30,983 --> 00:02:32,983
I didn't know this course had such a steep incline.

73
00:02:34,213 --> 00:02:36,382
- Seriously. It was very steep. - Yes.

74
00:02:36,383 --> 00:02:37,552
