- Dowoon. - Let's keep running, Hyun Moo.

91
00:03:14,823 --> 00:03:17,323
- Are you okay, Dowoon? - Don't use me as an excuse.

92
00:03:17,723 --> 00:03:18,763
I'm not doing that.

93
00:03:19,523 --> 00:03:21,892
- They started... Yes. - They started bickering now.

94
00:03:21,893 --> 00:03:23,262
- They're slightly tired. - See?

95
00:03:23,263 --> 00:03:24,903
People have conflicts when they start to get tired.

96
00:03:27,473 --> 00:03:28,833
The course for the head is tough, isn't it?

97
00:03:29,403 --> 00:03:30,473
- Yes. - Yes.

98
00:03:30,673 --> 00:03:32,303
- This course... - Definitely.

99
00:03:32,403 --> 00:03:33,942
- is an uphill path. - Yes.

100
00:03:33,943 --> 00:03:35,443
Oh, no. We're in trouble.

101
00:03:35,743 --> 00:03:37,342
Dowoon is walking now.

102
00:03:37,343 --> 00:03:39,143
