- The forehead... - We're almost there.

104
00:03:41,113 --> 00:03:42,553
- He doesn't look good. - Right.

105
00:03:42,653 --> 00:03:43,752
He shouldn't walk.

106
00:03:43,753 --> 00:03:44,753
(Worried)

107
00:03:45,253 --> 00:03:49,123
When it was around noon, I started to get tired.

108
00:03:49,793 --> 00:03:50,793
I bet.

109
00:03:50,993 --> 00:03:53,293
We kept eating throughout the run.

110
00:03:54,163 --> 00:03:56,533
I kept getting drowsy after the food consumption.

111
00:03:57,433 --> 00:03:59,102
- It was the food and the weather. - He must not have run hard.

112
00:03:59,103 --> 00:04:00,432
He got drowsy from the food while running.

113
00:04:00,433 --> 00:04:01,473
That's understandable.

114
00:04:02,033 --> 00:04:03,742
Oh, no. We're in trouble.

115
00:04:03,743 --> 00:04:05,002
(Moomoo is struggling too.)

116
00:04:05,003 --> 00:04:06,173
This part is the tough one.

117
00:04:07,273 --> 00:04:08,842
I didn't know the Fun Run could be tough.

118
00:04:08,843 --> 00:04:12,512
(I didn't know the Fun Run could be tough.)

119
00:04:12,513 --> 00:04:14,713
- Listen. - Hey. Why look down on them?

120
00:04:15,053 --> 00:04:17,582
I just thought they would be happy from start to finish.

121
00:04:17,583 --> 00:04:19,182
Then it won't be entertaining.

122
00:04:19,183 --> 00:04:20,393
Things get tough for us too.

123
00:04:20,853 --> 00:04:22,322
- It's... - "Things get tough for us too."

124
00:04:22,323 --> 00:04:23,763
There's drama in our run too.

125
00:04:25,423 --> 00:04:26,533
(Singing their crew song to overcome the crisis)

126
00:04:26,593 --> 00:04:28,193
- What? - Doraji

127
00:04:28,533 --> 00:04:31,833
- Moo Do Ra Ji - Moo Do Ra Ji

128
00:04:32,603 --> 00:04:34,772
- I was losing energy. - You guys are losing energy.

129
00:04:34,773 --> 00:04:35,803
We couldn't sing in sync.

130
00:04:36,543 --> 00:04:37,943
- We got this. - We got this.

131
00:04:39,973 --> 00:04:41,472
(Exhausted)

132
00:04:41,473 --> 00:04:43,312
Are we doing this right?

133
00:04:43,313 --> 00:04:45,483
No, listen. A lot of wild animals...

134
00:04:45,983 --> 00:04:47,783
- are sighted in this area. - Wait.

135
00:04:50,653 --> 00:04:52,023
Gosh, you know what?

136
00:04:52,423 --> 00:04:54,052
- That's tough. - It's so steep.

137
00:04:54,053 --> 00:04:55,223
- It was crazy. - The incline...

138
00:04:57,193 --> 00:04:58,322
We should've taken...

139
00:04:58,323 --> 00:05:00,063
- the uphill path earlier. - Right.

140
00:05:00,193 --> 00:05:01,963
Then we would be climbing down here.

141
00:05:02,433 --> 00:05:03,563
