145
00:05:10,743 --> 00:05:12,072
- We should go this way. - Let's go.

146
00:05:12,073 --> 00:05:13,142
Let's go.

147
00:05:13,143 --> 00:05:14,673
(They chose the flatland right away.)

148
00:05:15,813 --> 00:05:17,942
Had we taken the uphill, we would have run down here.

149
00:05:17,943 --> 00:05:19,713
- You had to run up at least once. - Right.

150
00:05:19,813 --> 00:05:21,152
- Starting with the uphill path... - The uphill like that...

151
00:05:21,153 --> 00:05:22,482
- could have been better. - Right.

152
00:05:22,483 --> 00:05:23,883
The same thought crossed my mind too.

153
00:05:25,683 --> 00:05:28,052
(Why did we choose the flatland earlier?)

154
00:05:28,053 --> 00:05:29,193
It's an uphill.

155
00:05:29,823 --> 00:05:30,863
Uphill.

156
00:05:32,023 --> 00:05:33,062
Never give up.

157
00:05:33,063 --> 00:05:34,063
(Sunken eyes)

158
00:05:34,064 --> 00:05:36,263
I've never seen your dark circles look this bad.

159
00:05:36,663 --> 00:05:38,603
- We can do this. - They're the biggest I've seen.

160
00:05:38,863 --> 00:05:39,972
This is "Dad's Challenge."

161
00:05:39,973 --> 00:05:41,333
It's just like that show.

162
00:05:41,473 --> 00:05:43,503
(Dad...)

163
00:05:43,973 --> 00:05:45,043
Come on.

164
00:05:45,703 --> 00:05:47,073
- It's okay. - Gosh.

165
00:05:47,513 --> 00:05:48,713
- Let's go. - Where are we?

166
00:05:49,613 --> 00:05:50,843
Hey, this is a mountain.

167
00:05:52,183 --> 00:05:54,312
