168
00:05:54,313 --> 00:05:55,313
(Glancing)

169
00:05:55,314 --> 00:05:56,622
- Okay. I'll go in the front. - Let's go.

170
00:05:56,623 --> 00:05:58,352
- Let's go. - Go.

171
00:05:58,353 --> 00:05:59,782
- Dowoon. - Dowoon.

172
00:05:59,783 --> 00:06:00,852
- Nice, Dowoon. - Hyun Moo.

173
00:06:00,853 --> 00:06:03,053
- Let's go. - No. Na Ra.

174
00:06:03,153 --> 00:06:04,423
- This is so touching. - Let's go.

175
00:06:04,493 --> 00:06:05,893
- Hyun Moo. - Let's go.

176
00:06:05,993 --> 00:06:07,693
(Na Ra pushes the dad of the group from behind.)

177
00:06:08,093 --> 00:06:09,662
Hyun Moo. Let's go.

178
00:06:09,663 --> 00:06:10,703
No.

179
00:06:11,103 --> 00:06:12,363
All right. Let's go.

180
00:06:12,703 --> 00:06:14,673
Why is there an uphill?

181
00:06:16,773 --> 00:06:18,403
(They run up the hill together.)

182
00:06:19,303 --> 00:06:20,973
The son is pushing the dad from behind.

183
00:06:21,513 --> 00:06:23,072
We're so close. We're almost there.

184
00:06:23,073 --> 00:06:24,142
- We're almost there. - We're almost there.

185
00:06:24,143 --> 00:06:26,382
- We completed the head. - We're here.

186
00:06:26,383 --> 00:06:27,412
(Looking after the tired dad)

187
00:06:27,413 --> 00:06:29,213
- We completed the head. - Let's go.

188
00:06:31,823 --> 00:06:33,293
- Na Ra. - Let's go.

189
00:06:33,423 --> 00:06:35,623
- Na Ra... - Don't abandon your dad.

190
00:06:35,793 --> 00:06:37,192
- Don't abandon him. - You guys make me proud.

191
00:06:37,193 --> 00:06:38,663
- Let's go. - Let's go.

192
00:06:39,723 --> 00:06:42,363
(But guys, I'm still here.)

193
00:06:44,403 --> 00:06:46,533
I'll go and get our chief.

194
00:06:46,973 --> 00:06:48,033
I'll go with you.

195
00:06:48,303 --> 00:06:49,702
- I'm making sure you're okay. - Ji Hyeon.

196
00:06:49,703 --> 00:06:51,743
- We're here to get you, Chief. - No.

197
00:06:51,803 --> 00:06:53,102
- We're a team. - Why...

198
00:06:53,103 --> 00:06:54,212
We're a team.

199
00:06:54,213 --> 00:06:56,443
- Why are you taking a break? - Okay.

200
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:58,242
Why are you taking a break?

201
00:06:58,243 --> 00:07:00,052
(The juniors are encouraging him once again.)

202
00:07:00,053 --> 00:07:01,153
It's not that.

203
00:07:02,553 --> 00:07:04,083
- You should lead us. - Hey. You guys...

204
00:07:05,983 --> 00:07:08,092
- You got it all wrong. - Let's go.

205
00:07:08,093 --> 00:07:09,653
- I was making sure you were okay. - Okay.

206
00:07:10,123 --> 00:07:11,723
I thought there was a tiger.

207
00:07:12,563 --> 00:07:14,463
- Watch out for the plane. - Watch out for the plane.

208
00:07:14,693 --> 00:07:15,893
Watch out for the landing plane.

209
00:07:16,493 --> 00:07:18,503
- We can do this. - Okay.

210
00:07:18,803 --> 00:07:19,833
We got this.

211
00:07:19,903 --> 00:07:21,732
- Let's go, plane! - Let's go, plane!

212
00:07:21,733 --> 00:07:23,002
Let's go, plane!

213
00:07:23,003 --> 00:07:25,303
- We'll start running from there... - Okay.

214
00:07:25,403 --> 00:07:27,413
- to complete the mouth. - Okay.

215
00:07:27,543 --> 00:07:29,212
Okay. It's an uphill. Let's run.

216
00:07:29,213 --> 00:07:30,513
- It's an uphill. Let's go. - Let's go.

217
00:07:31,113 --> 00:07:32,243
Let's go.

218
00:07:32,883 --> 00:07:34,353
Nice teamwork.

219
00:07:34,713 --> 00:07:37,023
- Of course. - This is quite touching.

220
00:07:37,253 --> 00:07:38,283
Yes. You're moved to tears, right?

221
00:07:38,923 --> 00:07:40,252
- Don't overdo it. - There are touching moments.

222
00:07:40,253 --> 00:07:41,253
Right.

223
00:07:41,893 --> 00:07:44,423
- Yes, there are touching moments. - Right, indeed.

224
00:07:45,823 --> 00:07:47,632
- We got this. - Let's go.

225
00:07:47,633 --> 00:07:49,533
(They're close to completing the uphill path.)

226
00:07:52,663 --> 00:07:53,773
We're good.

227
00:07:55,403 --> 00:07:56,502
We're good.

228
00:07:56,503 --> 00:07:57,972
(Arriving at the top of the uphill path)

229
00:07:57,973 --> 00:07:59,103
- Okay. We did it. - Gosh.

230
00:07:59,273 --> 00:08:00,913
Oh, my. They completed the tough part, the head.

231
00:08:01,273 --> 00:08:03,172
Breathe in some fresh air. Don't run now.

232
00:08:03,173 --> 00:08:04,313
- Okay. - This is nice.

233
00:08:04,643 --> 00:08:06,243
Hey, the vibe here is great.

234
00:08:07,813 --> 00:08:11,683
(That wasn't easy.)

235
00:08:13,083 --> 00:08:14,722
(Looking around)

236
00:08:14,723 --> 00:08:15,923
Are we going that way?

237
00:08:16,023 --> 00:08:17,292
- Chief Moo. - Yes.

238
00:08:17,293 --> 00:08:18,362
- "Chief Moo." - "Chief Moo."

239
00:08:18,363 --> 00:08:19,722
- Are you all right? - Of course.

240
00:08:19,723 --> 00:08:21,592
- Okay. We ran up quite a long path. - Right.

241
00:08:21,593 --> 00:08:22,662
Yes. Seriously.

242
00:08:22,663 --> 00:08:23,963
So...

243
00:08:25,063 --> 00:08:26,433
we started from Saimdang.

244
00:08:27,303 --> 00:08:28,673
We started from Saimdang.

245
00:08:30,173 --> 00:08:32,343
I can't tell just by looking at the pictures.

246
00:08:33,343 --> 00:08:34,373
Look.

247
00:08:34,913 --> 00:08:36,043
This is where we turned earlier.

248
00:08:36,883 --> 00:08:38,013
- Right? - Yes.

249
00:08:38,813 --> 00:08:39,883
The store?

250
00:08:41,253 --> 00:08:42,282
Look.

251
00:08:42,283 --> 00:08:45,482
(The crew chief is lost.)

252
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:46,583
What?

253
