2310
01:19:12,157 --> 01:19:13,197
One, two...

2311
01:19:13,667 --> 01:19:15,296
That's it. You need to push with your back against the wall.

2312
01:19:15,297 --> 01:19:16,767
They got it.

2313
01:19:16,837 --> 01:19:18,437
One, two, three.

2314
01:19:19,797 --> 01:19:20,936
We're almost done.

2315
01:19:20,937 --> 01:19:22,407
