2319
01:19:28,277 --> 01:19:29,307
We're done.

2320
01:19:31,917 --> 01:19:33,247
Gosh, you worked so hard.

2321
01:19:34,247 --> 01:19:35,517
We're done!

2322
01:19:36,387 --> 01:19:37,417
We're done.

2323
01:19:38,917 --> 01:19:40,657
Oh, my. Monde.

2324
01:19:44,927 --> 01:19:46,767
- I'll make you a nice meal. - Sounds good.

2325
01:19:47,167 --> 01:19:48,167
Hold on.

2326
01:19:48,927 --> 01:19:50,097
I'll make it quick.

2327
01:19:51,437 --> 01:19:53,807
