2331
01:20:02,807 --> 01:20:05,947
(He cooks quickly as he's worried about his friend who's hungry.)

2332
01:20:06,617 --> 01:20:08,187
- Gosh, it looks good. - Gosh.

2333
01:20:08,247 --> 01:20:10,616
