2339
01:20:23,227 --> 01:20:25,266
That's why I added the knife-cut noodles.

2340
01:20:25,267 --> 01:20:27,736
The sauce is absorbed in the noodles so well.

2341
01:20:27,737 --> 01:20:29,237
Right. Because they're thin.

2342
01:20:29,667 --> 01:20:32,277
- Gosh, you made this? - Yes.

2343
01:20:33,447 --> 01:20:35,176
Hold on. I'll make it delicious.

2344
01:20:35,177 --> 01:20:36,507
You did so much.

2345
01:20:37,147 --> 01:20:39,146
I think webfoot octopus will go well with gimbap.

2346
01:20:39,147 --> 01:20:40,247
- Right? - Because it's mild.

2347
01:20:40,547 --> 01:20:41,946
You know it needs konjac noodles, right?

2348
01:20:41,947 --> 01:20:42,987
Since it's webfoot octopus.

2349
01:20:43,557 --> 01:20:44,956
We're adding flying fish roe.

2350
01:20:44,957 --> 01:20:46,486
