2351
01:20:46,487 --> 01:20:47,657
Nice.

2352
01:20:49,357 --> 01:20:50,897
That's maesaengi tofu.

2353
01:20:51,157 --> 01:20:52,527
Gosh, he's a good cook.

2354
01:20:54,297 --> 01:20:57,036
YEONJUN likes noodles, and he likes spicy foods too.

2355
01:20:57,037 --> 01:20:58,397
(A table of Bum June's spicy stir-fried webfoot octopus)

2356
01:20:58,737 --> 01:20:59,767
Great job.

2357
01:21:00,467 --> 01:21:01,966
- Great job. - I'm hungry.

2358
01:21:01,967 --> 01:21:04,636
Bum June cooks properly.

2359
01:21:04,637 --> 01:21:05,807
He's really good.

2360
01:21:07,977 --> 01:21:09,877
- Gosh, this is crazy. - All right.

2361
01:21:10,447 --> 01:21:12,476
