2362
01:21:12,477 --> 01:21:14,787
- This is crazy, Bum June. - Add one piece of webfoot octopus.

2363
01:21:15,747 --> 01:21:16,787
And then...

2364
01:21:17,587 --> 01:21:20,757
Then I'll add mayonnaise on top.

2365
01:21:21,387 --> 01:21:23,187
And then... You know it, right?

2366
01:21:23,527 --> 01:21:24,897
Load the ssam with the flying fish roe.

2367
01:21:25,657 --> 01:21:26,926
You must add flying fish roe.

2368
01:21:26,927 --> 01:21:28,167
- That's a must. - Yes.

2369
01:21:29,027 --> 01:21:30,267
- He knows how to eat. - This is good.

2370
01:21:31,067 --> 01:21:33,736
And put this on top.

2371
01:21:33,737 --> 01:21:35,566
Hyun Moo, he's no joke.

2372
01:21:35,567 --> 01:21:37,477
He is really no joke. He really knows his stuff.

2373
01:21:38,407 --> 01:21:39,636
