2380
01:21:53,187 --> 01:21:54,327
How is it?

2381
01:21:55,787 --> 01:21:57,697
- It's crazy. - It's crazy? Is it good?

2382
01:21:59,257 --> 01:22:00,497
- It's good, right? - Yes.

2383
01:22:01,767 --> 01:22:02,797
Gosh.

2384
01:22:03,497 --> 01:22:04,637
You're good.

2385
01:22:04,697 --> 01:22:05,837
- It's delicious. - Yes.

2386
01:22:07,437 --> 01:22:09,637
(Taking another bite of webfoot octopus on top of gimbap)

2387
01:22:12,207 --> 01:22:13,406
(Amazed)

2388
01:22:13,407 --> 01:22:15,476
- I want to eat like that! - Adding webfoot octopus on top.

2389
01:22:15,477 --> 01:22:16,577
- My gosh! - That's right.

2390
01:22:17,777 --> 01:22:18,876
(Me too.)

2391
01:22:18,877 --> 01:22:20,147
This is driving me crazy.

2392
01:22:20,617 --> 01:22:21,617
Gosh.

2393
01:22:22,517 --> 01:22:23,916
Put the whole webfoot octopus on top.

2394
01:22:23,917 --> 01:22:25,686
(This time, it's a combination of tofu and webfoot octopus.)

2395
01:22:25,687 --> 01:22:27,887
- Gosh, this is amazing. - The tofu...

2396
01:22:28,187 --> 01:22:30,496
