2397
01:22:30,497 --> 01:22:32,526
- It's like cheese. - That's right.

2398
01:22:32,527 --> 01:22:34,597
- It's my first time seeing that. - It has the maesaengi aroma too.

2399
01:22:35,027 --> 01:22:36,397
Take a whole bite.

2400
01:22:37,567 --> 01:22:41,407
(Filling his mouth with tofu and webfoot octopus)

2401
01:22:43,637 --> 01:22:45,277
What do you think? This is it, right?

2402
01:22:45,737 --> 01:22:47,707
- It's crazy. - My gosh.

2403
01:22:48,547 --> 01:22:50,877
- You really like konjac noodles. - I love konjac noodles.

2404
01:22:52,017 --> 01:22:53,317
(Placing)

2405
