2418
01:23:20,607 --> 01:23:23,047
- You're right. - Have it with webfoot octopus.

2419
01:23:23,547 --> 01:23:24,746
- This is driving me crazy. - Gosh.

2420
01:23:24,747 --> 01:23:26,917
The rolled, frozen thinly sliced pork belly.

2421
01:23:27,387 --> 01:23:28,816
This is webfoot octopus with pork belly.

2422
01:23:28,817 --> 01:23:31,117
(Starting the 2nd round with webfoot octopus and pork belly)

2423
01:23:33,287 --> 01:23:35,256
