2432
01:23:53,777 --> 01:23:55,647
We get along well that we even go for 5 to 6 rounds.

2433
01:23:55,907 --> 01:23:59,047
He keeps up with me. We get along well when we eat.

2434
01:23:59,747 --> 01:24:00,787
YEONJUN.

2435
