2461
01:25:04,377 --> 01:25:05,476
- Really? - Yes.

2462
01:25:05,477 --> 01:25:07,246
- I'm glad. - Thank you so much.

2463
01:25:07,247 --> 01:25:08,347
I'm really glad.

2464
01:25:09,047 --> 01:25:10,186
I was really grateful.

2465
01:25:10,187 --> 01:25:12,256
