2470
01:25:22,567 --> 01:25:23,597
- He eats well. - Seriously.

2471
01:25:29,367 --> 01:25:30,506
He's sleeping for real?

2472
01:25:30,507 --> 01:25:32,276
- He slept for real. - He'd need that sleep.

2473
01:25:32,277 --> 01:25:33,647
I kept eating.

2474
01:25:34,047 --> 01:25:35,947
